{"id":"W58e372cc1f8023e7f3f1f33c","zh":"道床纵向阻力","en":"","name":"道床纵向阻力","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","concept_id":"C320cab46bb403c8025b3","families":[],"definition_zh":"有砟道床对轨道纵向移动的抵抗力。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"道床纵向阻力用于表征有砟道床对轨枕纵向移动的约束，可按每根轨枕所受阻力表示。在轮轨纵向相互作用分析中，可采用非线性关系描述这一约束。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W58e372cc1f8023e7f3f1f33c","text":"道床纵向阻力","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sd1eb93e953931bbee8f7","source_id":"P104","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"计算结果表明,当轨枕产生2 mm 位移时,道床纵向阻力平均值为9.884 kN/枕,略小于规范值 10 kN/枕,道床横向阻力平均值为11.047 kN/枕, 满足规范要求。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P073":{"id":"P073","title":"A coupling method for wheel–rail longitudinal interaction","authors":"L Pan, L Xu, X DU","year":"2025","doi":"10.1177/10775463241253355","journal_citation":"Journal of Vibration and Control 31 (11-12), 2142-2156","label":"Pan等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-a-coupling-method-for-wheel-rail-longitudinal-interaction"},"P104":{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"道床对轨枕纵向位移的抵抗能力，以每枕阻力表示。","language":"zh","source_id":"P104","paper_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"道床抵抗轨枕纵向移动的作用，本文考虑其非线性。","language":"zh","source_id":"P073","paper_slug":"2025-a-coupling-method-for-wheel-rail-longitudinal-interaction","title":"轮轨纵向相互作用的一种耦合方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links